## Interface: 100007, 16001
## Title: Spoken Quests
## Notes: Quest and gossip dialogue read aloud through Spoken. Restores quest and gossip voiceovers on supported clients.
## Notes-deDE: Quest- und Gesprächsdialoge, vorgelesen durch Spoken. Stellt die Quest- und Gesprächs-Vertonungen auf unterstützten Clients wieder her.
## Notes-esES: Diálogos de misiones y charlas leídos en voz alta a través de Spoken. Restaura las voces de misiones y charlas en clientes compatibles.
## Notes-esMX: Diálogos de misiones y charlas leídos en voz alta a través de Spoken. Restaura las voces de misiones y charlas en clientes compatibles.
## Notes-frFR: Dialogues de quêtes et de discussions lus à voix haute grâce à Spoken. Restaure les voix des quêtes et discussions sur les clients pris en charge.
## Notes-ptBR: Diálogos de missões e conversas lidos em voz alta através do Spoken. Restaura as vozes de missões e conversas em clientes suportados.
## Notes-ruRU: Диалоги заданий и разговоров, озвученные через Spoken. Возвращает озвучку заданий и разговоров на поддерживаемых клиентах.
## Notes-koKR: Spoken으로 퀘스트와 잡담 대사를 소리내어 읽습니다. 지원되는 클라이언트에서 퀘스트와 잡담 음성을 복원합니다.
## Notes-zhCN: 通过 Spoken 朗读任务和闲聊对话。在受支持的客户端上恢复任务和闲聊语音。
## Notes-zhTW: 透過 Spoken 朗讀任務和閒聊對話。在受支援的客戶端上恢復任務和閒聊語音。
## Version: 3.3.0
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Spoken_Quests\icon.tga
## SavedVariables: SpokenQuestsSettings
## OptionalDeps: Spoken, DialogueUI
# Spoken is the player this addon speaks through: optional, so a hand-installed copy
# without it loads and says what is missing; addon managers install it from the
# CurseForge dependency.
# DialogueUI, when installed, loads first so its window exists to be hooked: UI/DialogueUIBridge.lua.
## Group: Spoken
## X-Part-Of: Spoken
## X-VoiceOver-Player: 1

embeds.xml
addon.xml
Contribute.xml
# Gossip text for the client's own locale only: each file is ~2 MB of Lua, and a guard inside
# one returns only after the client has parsed it. AllowLoadTextLocale is a per-file directive
# from 11.1.5. The classic and legacy .toc files load Gossip\Gossip.xml instead: every locale,
# each guarded.
Gossip\Aliases.lua
Gossip\deDE.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale deDE]
Gossip\esES.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale esES]
Gossip\esMX.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale esMX]
Gossip\frFR.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale frFR]
Gossip\koKR.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale koKR]
Gossip\ptBR.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale ptBR]
Gossip\ruRU.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale ruRU]
Gossip\zhCN.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale zhCN]
Gossip\zhTW.lua [AllowLoadTextLocale zhTW]
